 the camp this week, and a lot of what follows is a direct answer to it. Here is what's been on the workbench. A first fight, not a tour Several of you told me the opening felt like reading a manual before you'd ever given an order. So I've been rebuilding it. The idea: your very first act should be a fight. A short, guided skirmish teaches moveme","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:37:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036053","verified_at":"2026-10-23T15:37:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053640-1846651706689245","game_id":"steam-5053640","kind":"announcement","title":"Co-op, Rebuilt","summary":"Co-op has been part of Free Company for a while. Now it actually feels like one company run by two people. You see your partner is on the map, you share the decisions that matter instead of just watching them happen, and the whole campaign holds together from the first contract to the last siege. Pick the jobs together. Weigh in on every call: one of you proposes, you both have a say, and the host makes it final. March as a single company and hold the line side by side, your bands and theirs on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:29:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689245","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053640-1846651706688964","game_id":"steam-5053640","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Company at Next Fest: Watch the Company Ride","summary":"Welcome to the Free Company broadcast. This is a looping reel of gameplay from the demo, running all through Steam Next Fest (October 19-26). It's pre-recorded, so I won't be answering chat from this stream, but I read every comment on the store page and in the community hub. What you're watching A mercenary company on the road in A.D. 997: contracts, recruiting, and marching the map. Turn-based battles fought band by band, where facing, high ground and formation matter. Permadeath. The men you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:22:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688964","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053640-1846651706673260","game_id":"steam-5053640","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Company on Steam Deck","summary":"I'm a solo dev, and I've built and playtested Free Company on Steam Deck the whole way through, not bolted it on at the end. The controls, the on-screen text size, and the battle interface were all tuned on the device across a lot of Deck sessions. What that means for you:Full controller support out of the box. The default layout plays the entire demo, no settings to change, no mouse or keyboard needed, and the on-screen prompts match your controller.Runs at the Deck's native 1280x800 at a smoot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T06:00:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673260","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053640-1846018067933652","game_id":"steam-5053640","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"Demo Update, and the Road to Launch The demo has been out a little while now, and watching people take up the seal and run their own company has been the best part of this whole project. Thank you to everyone who has played it, broken it, and sent me notes. Here is a demo update built straight from that feedback, plus a look at where the company goes next, because the demo was never the finish line. It was the first camp on a longer road. What just landed in the demo A round of fixes, a lot of i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T15:09:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053640-1846018067925232","game_id":"steam-5053640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Is Live!","summary":"The Demo Is Out: Take the Seal Free Company's demo is live for Steam Next Fest. Download it, muster your band, and see if you've got the nerve to lead one. It's A.D. 997. No crown stands behind you, no levy raised by writ. Just a seal, a muster roll, and the contracts you're willing to take. You run the company: you hire the bands, march the roads, pick the fights, and live with what they cost. Every man on the roll is one you chose, and permadeath means every one you lose is one you'll remember","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T07:20:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925232","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053640-1845383656385112","game_id":"steam-5053640","kind":"announcement","title":"Five Days to the Demo","summary":"Five Days to the Demo Hello, sellswords. The Free Company demo releases on October 7th. This week was all about polish, bug hunting and getting it ready, and that's how I'll spend every day until launch. Co-op is in the demoFor a while I wasn't sure co-op should be in the demo at all. Two players sharing one campaign across the internet is a lot that can go wrong, and I didn't want your first impression to be a dropped connection. After this week's testing, I'm happy with it. Co-op is going in, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T06:26:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385112","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053640-1844751498224170","game_id":"steam-5053640","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Has a Date","summary":"Hello, sellswords. The big news first: the Free Company demo releases on October 7th. Mark it down, wishlist the game if you haven't, and get ready to raise a banner in A.D. 997. https://store.steampowered.com/app/5053640/ Most of this week went into how the game looks and feels to play, so the demo is in good shape when you get your hands on it. A cleaner war table The company at a glance. A new top bar shows your silver, renown, objectives, recruits waiting, and which way the Church-to-Measure","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T11:07:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224170","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053640-1844115010494095","game_id":"steam-5053640","kind":"announcement","title":"The Company Finds Its Voice","summary":"Another week heads-down on Free Company. It was a big one, so here's what's been on the workbench. Some of it new, some of it still being hammered into shape.A narrator for the chronicleThe thing I'm most excited about: the company's story is starting to be spoken. I've been building a voice layer around Cornelius, a grave late-tenth-century chronicler who reads the omens, the battles, and the small exchanges between your captains around the fire. This week the first recordings went in. Chronicl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T08:31:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494095","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053640-1843481262701373","game_id":"steam-5053640","kind":"announcement","title":"The Ones Who Lead","summary":"The trailer is here. The first one that actually shows the company armed, animated, and led. If you've been pulling up a chair on the workbench these past months, this is the thing all of it was building toward. Give it a watch up top, then here's everything behind it.Two big things landed in this stretch, and together they changed how the company feels to command: your captains became people you can lose, and the whole company finally moves like it's alive.Your captains are people nowA captain ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T11:02:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701373","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5053640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:33Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5053640":"2026-10-26T07:38:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5053640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:33Z"},"5189490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:34Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5053640","app_id":5053640,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","cont